<title>USA: Osicom Technologies Q2 net loss vs profit. [CORRECTED 16/9 00:05GMT]</title>
<headline>Osicom Technologies Q2 net loss vs profit. [CORRECTED 16/9 00:05GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.32   profit	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net loss		   8,311   profit	   305</p>
<p> Revs			10,757		    6,686</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,593		    2,919</p>
<p>(Corrects 1996 share loss from $2.08 and Avg shrs figure from 4,007)</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.31     loss	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,860     loss	   224</p>
<p> Revs			22,029		   12,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,432		    2,798</p>
<p>(Corrects 1996 share loss from $2.06 and the avg shrs figure from 3,846)</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 96 Q2 includes a charge of $7.6 million for acquisitions and amortizations. The six-month 96 period includes a charge of $7.7 million.</p>
<p>The full company name is Osicom Technologies Inc.</p>
